\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {5}{\ignorespaces Registered calendar-block analysis (three equal contiguous blocks per series; same pipeline and verdict rules as Table\nonbreakingspace \ref {tab:battery}). The pre-stated seismic test (selection-aware bound above $0.03$ in every block) fails in block\nonbreakingspace 1. ``Adds'' means history adds, with its certificate. Both history-adds series carry their value in one or two regimes, and the block certificates exceed the pooled ones where history pays. Homogeneity of the lag-1 transition matrices is rejected for every series (chi-square, df $=4$, $p\le 10^{-4}$).}}{17}{table.caption.10}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:regimes}{{5}{17}{Registered calendar-block analysis (three equal contiguous blocks per series; same pipeline and verdict rules as Table~\ref {tab:battery}). The pre-stated seismic test (selection-aware bound above $0.03$ in every block) fails in block~1. ``Adds'' means history adds, with its certificate. Both history-adds series carry their value in one or two regimes, and the block certificates exceed the pooled ones where history pays. Homogeneity of the lag-1 transition matrices is rejected for every series (chi-square, df $=4$, $p\le 10^{-4}$)}{table.caption.10}{}}
